{
  "schema_version": "argument_graph/0.1",
  "example_id": "persuade:2CCFB8C0BAF7",
  "root": "u4",
  "units": [
    {
      "id": "u1",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 56,
      "text": "Would students learn more at home rather than at school?",
      "role": "lead",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u2",
      "start": 57,
      "end": 196,
      "text": "This is a highly debated question in the educational world as many schools are considering adopting \"distance learning\" for their students.",
      "role": "lead",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u3",
      "start": 197,
      "end": 271,
      "text": "Some students who are sick or injured may benefit from a home environment.",
      "role": "counterclaim",
      "stance": "conceded",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u4",
      "start": 272,
      "end": 429,
      "text": "However, the majority would struggle due to distractions, distance between student and teacher, and the lack of an authoritative figure to keep them on task.",
      "role": "position",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u5",
      "start": 431,
      "end": 592,
      "text": "Many students are easily distracted in school, so in a room full of things much more interesting than classwork, there is an even greater chance for distraction.",
      "role": "claim",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u7",
      "start": 593,
      "end": 711,
      "text": "Along with this, for those students who's parents work outside of the home, there is no one to help keep them on task.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u8",
      "start": 712,
      "end": 805,
      "text": "That is a lot to ask for a young adolescent with distractions such as video games, pets, etc.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u9",
      "start": 806,
      "end": 978,
      "text": "Throughout the development of my education, I have discovered staying focused and on track to be one of the most difficult things to do, especially while in one's own room.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u11",
      "start": 979,
      "end": 1118,
      "text": "Therefore, the addition of distance learning would create an epidemic of kids who are unfocused, adding to the already skyrocketing amount.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u12",
      "start": 1119,
      "end": 1261,
      "text": "In the past 10 to 20 years the quantity of kids and teenagers claiming or being diagnosed with ADD and ADHD has reached unprecedented heights.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u13",
      "start": 1262,
      "end": 1372,
      "text": "Adding these students or others to a home environment with toys, games, and a bed is just asking for problems.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u14",
      "start": 1374,
      "end": 1443,
      "text": "One main issue with learning from home is the absence of the teacher.",
      "role": "claim",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u15",
      "start": 1444,
      "end": 1541,
      "text": "For, the only way for the teacher to reach his or her student would be through a computer screen.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u16",
      "start": 1542,
      "end": 1592,
      "text": "Video calls are a very useful piece of technology;",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "conceded",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u17",
      "start": 1593,
      "end": 1742,
      "text": "however, from a teaching standpoint, they provide very little gratification, nor do they achieve the same goals compared to a face to face encounter.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u18",
      "start": 1743,
      "end": 1856,
      "text": "Depending on the time of classes and calls, the teacher and student may not always be available at the same time.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u19",
      "start": 1857,
      "end": 1924,
      "text": "This would expand the distance between the student and the teacher.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u20",
      "start": 1925,
      "end": 2049,
      "text": "Such a gap can cause a student to feel stranded in an ocean of equations, since there is no teacher to help save him or her.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u23",
      "start": 2050,
      "end": 2110,
      "text": "While most teachers hate to believe it, most students cheat.",
      "role": "claim",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u25",
      "start": 2111,
      "end": 2232,
      "text": "And in a room all by themselves, with internet access, there is no doubt many would cheat on tests and quizzes with ease.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u26",
      "start": 2233,
      "end": 2353,
      "text": "From personal experience, it is way to easy to find a classwork or homework assignment on a pdf document through Google.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u27",
      "start": 2355,
      "end": 2487,
      "text": "Shying away from the learning portion of the debate, a school is a cultural hub where long lasting lessons and friendships are made.",
      "role": "claim",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u28",
      "start": 2488,
      "end": 2589,
      "text": "While many students feel they could go the rest of their lives without stepping foot in school again,",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "reported",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u29",
      "start": 2590,
      "end": 2713,
      "text": "the loss of such an important place would leave students with a weaker connection to friends and a poor social development.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u30",
      "start": 2714,
      "end": 2782,
      "text": "The lessons learned in school, don't always happen in the classroom;",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u31",
      "start": 2783,
      "end": 2845,
      "text": "they can occur in the halls, the gym, or even the locker room.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u32",
      "start": 2846,
      "end": 2937,
      "text": "These lessons become part of who we are and how we continue to grow as students and humans.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u33",
      "start": 2939,
      "end": 2993,
      "text": "Now, of course there are benefits to learning at home.",
      "role": "counterclaim",
      "stance": "conceded",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u34",
      "start": 2994,
      "end": 3136,
      "text": "A great portion of students today are sleep\u00a0deprived and also through personal experience, the lack of sleep greatly affects student's grades.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "conceded",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u35",
      "start": 3137,
      "end": 3243,
      "text": "So, with the idea of learning from home, many kids may be able to sleep in and gain some much needed rest.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "conceded",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u36",
      "start": 3244,
      "end": 3295,
      "text": "This alone could boost grades for lots of students.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "conceded",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u37",
      "start": 3296,
      "end": 3388,
      "text": "However, there is no guarantee students will obtain an increase in sleep through the change.",
      "role": "rebuttal",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u38",
      "start": 3389,
      "end": 3491,
      "text": "As the amount of sleep a student gets, directly correlates to the amount of homework that is assigned.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u39",
      "start": 3492,
      "end": 3689,
      "text": "In other words, without a decrease in the amount of homework assigned, there will continue to be tired students who fall asleep during class and struggle to stay awake during long, boring lectures.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u40",
      "start": 3691,
      "end": 3780,
      "text": "Overall, the incorporation of a distance learning option for students is not a good idea.",
      "role": "concluding_summary",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u41",
      "start": 3781,
      "end": 3907,
      "text": "With students who are still tired, cheating, and struggling to stay focused there seems to be little to no gain from the plan.",
      "role": "concluding_summary",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u42",
      "start": 3908,
      "end": 4015,
      "text": "However, an experiment could be done with a few schools to determine the true effectiveness of the program.",
      "role": "concluding_summary",
      "stance": "conceded",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u43",
      "start": 4016,
      "end": 4114,
      "text": "But, until then the evidence and the conclusion is against the addition of long distance learning.",
      "role": "concluding_summary",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    }
  ],
